+    {
+      title: "Page through captures",
+      description: "Read captures in creation order. Pass the last position back as the exclusive cursor. An empty page means the end. Each shareable row has a text preview (up to 4096 characters), a SHA-256 of the full text, and a revision date. Other rows carry a position only.",
